= Create a website of games - instead of downloading ROMS (illegal) we instead download machine memory mid-play. The user then resumes from this save point (during game over), plays the game, it then detects when the game is over, and uploads the memory to the webserver. It allows the player to play again (if no one else is waiting to play), but if someone else is waiting to play, it ends the game, and asks if they want to join the queue or play a different game.
= Create the ability for games as they are being played to be streamed to the server (so others can watch).
= See if video codecs that store vector graphics exist, and see if we can save game play using it (and streaming).
